<title>CANADA: Canada C$3.0 bln bond due 1999 yields 4.012 pct.</title>
<headline>Canada C$3.0 bln bond due 1999 yields 4.012 pct.</headline>
<dateline>OTTAWA 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Government of Canada on Wednesday said its C$3.0 billion auction of 4 percent bonds due March 15, 1999 produced the following results:</p>
<p>			     YIELD	 PRICE</p>
<p>		   AVG     4.012	99.970  PCT AT</p>
<p>		   LOW     4.000	99.995  HI YIELD</p>
<p>		   HIGH    4.023	99.946   4.76</p>
<p>Bids from primary dealers totalled C$6,599.55 million, including C$69.05 million non-competitive tenders at the average yield. The bonds will be dated and delivered on Dec 16. Proceeds of the issue will be used for general purposes.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau (416) 941-8100))</p>
